        "<p>Dermal fillers are not approved for breast enlargement, and regulators advise against using them for this purpose because of potentially serious complications. A filler approved for facial use should not be assumed suitable for injection into the breasts.</p>",
        "<p>PRP’s effects depend on the specific indication and the evidence available. It should not be marketed as a proven method of increasing breast size without robust evidence supporting that particular use.</p>",
